# Ommi Forge — legacy WordPress URLs → App Router paths
# Netlify-style _redirects file. Honoured by Netlify, Cloudflare Pages,
# and most static-host CDN rule engines. A client-side fallback in
# src/components/providers/LegacyRedirects.tsx covers hosts that don't
# read this file (e.g. plain Hostinger static).
#
# NOTE: `trailingSlash: true` in next.config.ts emits `/foo/index.html`,
# so the targets below all use trailing slashes. Both with-slash and
# without-slash source forms are included to cover any inbound style.

